#!/bin/sh
# Run the catalogue CLI from anywhere: `path/to/headwaters/hw find tide`.
# Apple's /usr/bin/python3 is preferred deliberately -- the python.org build on this
# machine ships without a CA bundle, so every HTTPS call from it fails while curl works.
PY=/usr/bin/python3
[ -x "$PY" ] || PY=python3
exec "$PY" "$(dirname "$0")/src/hw.py" "$@"
